  "releaseNotes": "Refactor encryption services and mark BinaryParser obsolete\n\n      Implements several architectural improvements:\n      \n      - Moves IDisposable to IEncryptionService interface\n      - Marks BinaryParser as obsolete in favor of      FastBinaryParser\n      - Adds x86/x64 platform targets to solution\n      - Creates new BosonWare.Runtime.Lab project\n      - Bumps version to 1.1.0 for interface changes\n      \n      Code style improvements to RSAEncryptionService for       better readability",
